{"4953820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Peekablock", "steam_appid": 4953820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer hide-and-seek</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple 3D building and painting tools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player-made disguises, weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wall-climbing and unusual hiding spots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >End-of-match showcase and voting</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD ANYTHING. HIDE AS ANYTHING.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peekablock</strong> is a multiplayer hide-and-seek party game where Hiders build and paint their own disguises and Hunters try to spot the fakes. Blend into the map, fool your friends, and survive rounds of betrayal, taunts, and very bad hiding spots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953820/extras/8ac58a8f8e4124ea5774c84bee4dccc5.poster.avif?t=1787981400\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953820/extras/8ac58a8f8e4124ea5774c84bee4dccc5.webm?t=1787981400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953820/extras/8ac58a8f8e4124ea5774c84bee4dccc5.mp4?t=1787981400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR DISGUISE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine simple shapes, change their size, rotate them, and paint every piece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mimic an object from the map or invent something nobody has seen before. <strong>If it works .. it works .. no questions asked.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953820/extras/66473d8933407345d794592a6db528ff.poster.avif?t=1787981400\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953820/extras/66473d8933407345d794592a6db528ff.webm?t=1787981400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953820/extras/66473d8933407345d794592a6db528ff.mp4?t=1787981400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953820/extras/26ea7edec88e856d107270928507dfcd.poster.avif?t=1787981400\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953820/extras/26ea7edec88e856d107270928507dfcd.webm?t=1787981400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953820/extras/26ea7edec88e856d107270928507dfcd.mp4?t=1787981400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HIDE. HUNT. PANIC.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As a <strong>Hider</strong>, blend into the map, strike the perfect pose, and climb into unexpected hiding spots.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953820/extras/78b45e80e871d9100fbe540a12a001f2.poster.avif?t=1787981400\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953820/extras/78b45e80e871d9100fbe540a12a001f2.webm?t=1787981400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953820/extras/78b45e80e871d9100fbe540a12a001f2.mp4?t=1787981400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As the <strong>Hunter</strong>, study the scene, find what does not belong, and catch everyone before time runs out.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953820/extras/d950d58a6e82fe717a621178edf93fbb.poster.avif?t=1787981400\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953820/extras/d950d58a6e82fe717a621178edf93fbb.webm?t=1787981400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953820/extras/d950d58a6e82fe717a621178edf93fbb.mp4?t=1787981400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>As a <strong>Ghost </strong>(caught hiders) disturb your fellow hiders or troll the hunters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953820/extras/054a682e5c4ea605826cfb007a39881f.poster.avif?t=1787981400\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953820/extras/054a682e5c4ea605826cfb007a39881f.webm?t=1787981400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953820/extras/054a682e5c4ea605826cfb007a39881f.mp4?t=1787981400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE MORE THAN PROPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the building tools to create <strong>weapons </strong>and <strong>disguises.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a heroic Hunter, a ridiculous sword, or an entire hide-and-seek playground built around your own ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953820/extras/2988a8a68a5f712ad5ea7549e74b7504.poster.avif?t=1787981400\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953820/extras/2988a8a68a5f712ad5ea7549e74b7504.webm?t=1787981400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953820/extras/2988a8a68a5f712ad5ea7549e74b7504.mp4?t=1787981400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHOW OFF YOUR BEST BUILDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the hunt, see every hiding spot, check out the Hunter’s custom look and weapon, and vote for the hiders/hunters you liked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning is good. <strong>doing something everyone remembers is better.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953820/extras/7faf2f34e62da3c65b7b7ac4612bcae1.avif?t=1787981400\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953820/extras_big/7faf2f34e62da3c65b7b7ac4612bcae1.webp?t=1787981400 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Coming Sooner Than You Think</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own hiders and new poses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design new looks and weapons for hunters and share it all on steam workshop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access other players creations and play them yourself.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste